{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f6bf1c6ae56f58c42ddf141736d6eafd548140561735684bb05ef1babb14be26", "ja": "（今日は律子のPV撮影だ。たくさんの綺麗な花に\n囲まれた、最高のロケーションだが……）", "zh": "（今天是律子的PV拍摄。虽然这是被众多美丽花朵包围的绝佳取景地，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "9439fd943169db160fceb8bbf101314786a4dbf8abfd4f1fc41a4015d17d3384", "ja": "さあ、張り切っていきましょうか！\nいい撮影にしましょうね、{$P$}！", "zh": "那么，打起精神上吧！\n一起拍出精彩的作品吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1002_p", "source_sha256": "72b98fb05098e372103f1395d88b618f95860fba05f19fbf2874d5d80d02f749", "ja": "おおっ、今日はずいぶんやる気だな！", "zh": "哦，今天干劲十足啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "e8f5b484c567fee19178242473d6105fceb0092ca8a63d625618022d230b3248", "ja": "それはもう……衣装もいいし、場所も天気もいいし。\nせっかくなので、私も最高を目指そうかと。", "zh": "那是当然……服装也很棒，地点和天气也都不错。\n难得有这样的机会，我也想朝着最棒的表现努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a62ce18e1b1d0174ca08ce4858d43d9fbf2dc13a17696b2a8332c4a8b5fda81d", "ja": "よーし！　そのやる気を生かすためにも、\n今日は少しくらい、ワガママを言ってもいいぞ。", "zh": "好——！为了发挥出这份干劲，\n今天你稍微任性一点也没关系哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "79af011e646ceddbd142d7f98c22422ecc8273cf95fbad356530f7c556bda211", "ja": "ほんとですか？　じゃあちょっと、\n勝手なお願いをしちゃおうかな。", "zh": "真的吗？那我就任性地提个小小的请求吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "b26e38fd74ed39d720fc0abdbb8ca6a505fbdbc7dca2196b4445f0f8de76ca6c", "ja": "私が撮影で持つ予定の花束なんですけど、\n今から変えてもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "我在拍摄时预计要拿的那束花，\n能不能从现在开始换一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f7f7710732082db02e6618d7f2d33533d930b1516edd1fb0a6e04e81be829f0b", "ja": "え、意外なところから来たな。\n用意できそうなものなら構わないけど……。", "zh": "诶，还真是从意想不到的地方下手啊。  \n只要是能准备到的东西倒是没问题，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "d280f02cfb92cdc18a75459e1853e67386bb16a54b4ecfb11da59c593c33fb4e", "ja": "それなら、ユリの花を。黄色がいいです。", "zh": "那就要百合花。黄色的就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1009_p", "source_sha256": "bf03217ab7f7725488a73bdf67654fa5749199887b88ba346ea24b7af5d7ea9b", "ja": "わかった。でも、どうして黄色のユリなんだ？", "zh": "知道了。不过，为什么是黄色的百合呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "46278d2c1758c5ad122ac205f810d4ecf967e451c9a8b5dff3a1dd3e33df099e", "ja": "ユリというのはですね、古くから権威の象徴に\nなったり、はたまた不吉のしるしになったり……。", "zh": "百合这种花呢，自古以来既是权威的象征，有时又会成为不祥的征兆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "fe3432c15e03cab09fef7bfa31f57f6f243f07b42dd3f46a3aba5b7a443b97d8", "ja": "でも特に、黄色の花がね。こないだ調べて気に入って。\n黄色いユリの花言葉、知ってますか？", "zh": "不过尤其是黄色的花。我前些天查了查，很喜欢。你知道黄色百合的花语吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1012_p", "source_sha256": "946d589ac349368c17e79b704ec4eeda975798ccd38ec49768ffc690d9e8f93b", "ja": "いや……どんな言葉なのかな。教えてくれるか。", "zh": "不……是代表什么呢？可以告诉我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "ec3f1d78454f108161c0b8e39cfe107a33bfd1f4bfcf7c67fbee5104a7d6dd34", "ja": "ウソです。", "zh": "我骗你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "5d573763f53343e060024dd4cd60e3493b7540420f9b8554b5a6e85aef84a945", "ja": "花言葉は嘘、偽り。今日の綺麗に飾った姿の\n私がその花束を抱いたら、似合うと思いませんか？", "zh": "花语是谎言、虚假。今天打扮得漂漂亮亮的我抱着那束花，不觉得很相称吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "449ce101b08d71cd9217177991ff3ac1172e1e1725b57deffd952ff9243f2477", "ja": "……ふふっ、なんて顔ですか。大丈夫ですよ。\nだって……楽しい嘘をつきたい気分なんです。", "zh": "……呵呵，您这是什么表情啊。没事的啦。\n因为……我现在的心情，就是很想撒个开心的谎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "ce83fd4d3f63a5fb7fadfa78a859c181b6976ea9cf1c2d3eab097bf6102f364b", "ja": "見てくれる人達のために、頑張りたい私を……\n花はもっと、よく引き立ててくれそうだなって。", "zh": "我想为那些看着我的人努力加油……\n感觉花能更好地衬托出那样的我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2c27217117485ac32cd4e4f5b7c4183e283d83ac74e4f013ef9daea82554c957", "ja": "そうか……そうだな。律子のやる気に役立つなら\nユリの花は、必ず調達するよ。", "zh": "这样啊……确实如此。要是能帮上律子的干劲，\n我一定会弄到百合花的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2bfe392ddfdcc40b003620b0c940c160d4bb0f400ec2167cf1e078a7b6697d64", "ja": "しかし、楽しい嘘か……そんな風に言いながら、\n実は本気の素顔を見せてくれるんだろう？", "zh": "不过，开心的谎言吗……嘴上这么说，其实会让我看到你认真而真实的一面吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "5c4da68ae24dbbc7878b29e9664da0d4f3da9a6a64f8a000703a2993cdf7e8db", "ja": "さ～て、どうでしょう。私はアイドル。\n素敵な嘘で誰かを喜ばせるのがお仕事。だから……。", "zh": "这个嘛～谁知道呢。我是偶像。用美好的谎言让别人开心，就是我的工作。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "5bf5194e236a8b6340c75104a69253e225cf4950dd7a918723406aa0fc661afb", "ja": "付き合ってください、{$P$}。\n今日の私の、とっておきの嘘に。", "zh": "请配合我，{$P$}。配合我今天这场特别的谎言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1022_p", "source_sha256": "cc573af0c081690346f17d244c5b118801327fcdf57e51b53e45a525c0e58a97", "ja": "（いや、嘘だけじゃない。\nユリの花は、多くの意味を持っている）", "zh": "（不，不只是谎言。\n百合花有着许多含义）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0254_1023_p", "source_sha256": "5fb2a5ae05d00f708d6f8920d1f7657787da988dd012eb46527080e64cb750f0", "ja": "（何も隠さないそのままを、素直に見せてくれる日も\nあるはずだ……その機会を必ず、見届けよう）", "zh": "（她一定也会有毫不隐瞒、坦率地展现真实自我的时候……我一定要亲眼见证那个机会。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
